TITLE H2SO4 additions to pure water (pH 7)
SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    water 1

REACTION 1
    H2SO4 1
    0.001 0.005 0.01 0.05 0.1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -totals S(6)
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step_mol	pH
    10 PUNCH RXN, -LA("H+")
END
